# Chakra OS security tools menu -- one launcher per line.
# Name|category_id|exec command|needs_root(0/1)
# Launches in a terminal (Terminal=true) unless the tool has its own GUI,
# in which case it's handled separately in apply_security_menu() by
# recategorizing the package's own .desktop file instead of duplicating it.

# 01 - Information Gathering
Nmap|01-info-gathering|nmap|0
Whois|01-info-gathering|whois|0
Recon-ng|01-info-gathering|recon-ng|0
Netdiscover|01-info-gathering|netdiscover|1
Arp-scan|01-info-gathering|arp-scan|1
DNS Lookup (dig)|01-info-gathering|dig|0

# 02 - Vulnerability Analysis
Nikto|02-vuln-analysis|nikto|0
